meta {
  name: Delete Monev
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

delete {
  url: {{host}}/api/admin/monev/:id
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  id: your-monev-uuid-here
}

docs {
  # DELETE /api/admin/monev/:id
  
  Menghapus record Monev.
  
  ## Path Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type | Description |
  |-----------|------|-------------|
  | id | UUID | ID monev yang akan dihapus |
  
  ## Response Success (200)
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Monev berhasil dihapus"
  }
  ```
  
  ## Response Error (404)
  ```json
  {
    "success": false,
    "message": "Monev tidak ditemukan"
  }
  ```
  
  ## Notes
  - Penghapusan bersifat permanen (hard delete)
  - File dokumen terkait (berita_acara, form_penilaian) tidak otomatis dihapus
}
